80}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-29.6.1","local_name":"bob-cli-29.6.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-29.6","agent_clan_generation":"20260928090643","approve":true,"bead_id":"bob-cli-29.6.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-29.6[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Finish the =x Pomodoro close contract in bob-cli and Bob Mac [/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]         [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Close the gaps the bob-cli-29 land audit found. In bob-cli, `bob [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]capture =x` and its link forms honor the plan's JSON, human, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]diagnostic contract for any `-b` path, with the required tests. In [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Bob Mac Capture, the close preview, footer, palette, and [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]notifications match the plan's mac spec, use fixtures generated [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]from the fixed bob, and pass macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]pomodoro_close_closeout.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/pomodoro_close_closeout.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/capture_pomodoro_close.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-29.6[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-29/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]bob-cli-29.6.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli close contract fixes, clippy cleanup, docs, and [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]required tests[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]close-contract-fixes[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]close-contract-fixes: in bob-cli, fix five things. (1) A relative `-b` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]path double-joins the vault dir, so every task effect is skipped. (2) [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`raw` is wrong on link forms. (3) Non-carried rows report [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`tasks[].carried`. (4) Link-form diagnostics, the human header and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]locator, and link-form `placement` are wrong. (5) The JSON drops nulls [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and keeps a `#task` prefix on embedded rows. Also fix the 12 clippy [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]warnings the epic introduced and the gaps in docs/capture.md, and add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the integration and protocol tests the parent plan required.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture close preview to spec, real-bob fixtures, and [bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]green macOS CI[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-close-finish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after close-contract-fixes[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-close-finish: in bob-mac-capture, fix the failing close presentation[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]test, and bring the presentation, card, model, palette mapping, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notifications up to the parent plan's mac-close-preview spec. Regenerate[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]every close fixture from bob-cli built at the close-contract-fixes [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]commit, add the missing fixtures and tests, update the README, and get a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]green `macOS 26 SwiftPM` CI run.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-29.6","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-29.6.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-4d7acda2f31b98878801d9743309be6f","started_at":"2026-09-28T13:06:55.46